e_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-066-liuhong-ws1527632","s-sanguozhi-051-shao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin066-liufu-grandfather","subject_person_id":"5is_zik_jbp","object_person_id":"ofy_r4x_l1b","predicate":"grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"祖馥，魏揚州刺史"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-liuhong-ws1527632","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p001","quote":"劉弘，字和季，沛國相人也。祖馥，魏揚州刺史。父靖，鎮北將軍。弘有幹略政事之才，少家洛陽，與武帝同居永安裏，又同年，共研席。以舊恩起家太子門大夫，累遷率更令，轉太宰長史。張華甚重之。由是為甯朔將軍、假節、監幽州諸軍事，領烏丸校尉，甚有威惠，寇盜屏跡，為幽朔所稱。以勳德兼茂，封宣城公。太安中，張昌作亂，轉使持節、南蠻校尉、荊州刺史，率前將軍趙驤等討昌，自方城至宛、新野，所向皆平。及新野王歆之敗也，以弘代為鎮南將軍、都督荊州諸軍事，餘官如故。弘遣南蠻長史陶侃為大都護，參軍蒯恆為義軍督護，牙門將皮初為都戰帥，進據襄陽。張昌並軍圍宛，敗趙驤軍，弘退屯梁。侃、初等累戰破昌，前後斬首數萬級。及到官，昌懼而逃，其眾悉降，荊土平。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p001:m0014"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"傳明祖馥與官。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p001:m0014","surface":"馥","start":14,"end":15,"person_id":"ofy_r4x_l1b","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuho